@startuml state-run
title Run statuses (run.status)
[*] --> RECEIVED : ChangeSet accepted
RECEIVED --> SKIPPED : no events / no-docs label
RECEIVED --> PROPOSED : branch + model MR created
RECEIVED --> NEEDS_REVIEW : unresolved targets\nor validation errors
RECEIVED --> FAILED : error (git, LLM, model)
PROPOSED --> APPROVED : MR merged / approve
NEEDS_REVIEW --> APPROVED : analyst fixed and merged
PROPOSED --> REJECTED : MR closed / reject
APPROVED --> PUBLISHED : all blocks updated
APPROVED --> PARTIALLY_PUBLISHED : some blocks in CONFLICT
PARTIALLY_PUBLISHED --> PUBLISHED : conflict resolved,\nre-publish
SKIPPED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
PUBLISHED --> [*]
@enduml
